# oracle: w310gneb_cg — w194gneb_chain with min_style spin/cg: the multireplica branch of MinSpinCG (the end replicas keep their spins, the Fletcher-Reeves sums run over all replicas, the timestep follows the largest torque of all replicas)
# oracle-partitions: 4
# oracle-inputs: w194gneb_chain.data w194gneb_chain.final
# oracle-compare: rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10 printed=8
# Measured with native LAMMPS: the 14 table rows agree at the printed precision (8 significant digits); unrounded, the largest difference is 3.2e-8 (RDT of the last row), the printed digits themselves.
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style spin
atom_modify map array
read_data w194gneb_chain.data
mass 1 55.845
pair_style spin/exchange 3.0
pair_coeff * * exchange 3.0 0.02726 0.2171 1.841
neighbor 0.1 bin
neigh_modify every 10 check yes delay 20
fix 1 all precession/spin zeeman 0.1 0.0 0.0 1.0 anisotropy 0.0001 1.0 0.0 0.0
fix_modify 1 energy yes
fix 3 all neb/spin 1.0
timestep 0.0001
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step pe
thermo_modify format float %.15g
min_style spin/cg
min_modify line spin_none discrete_factor 10.0
neb/spin 0.0 0.0 60 60 10 final w194gneb_chain.final
